<title>UKRAINE: Hryvnia edged down to 1.82 from 1.81 per dlr in Kiev.</title>
<headline>Hryvnia edged down to 1.82 from 1.81 per dlr in Kiev.</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The hryvnia edged down to 1.82 per dollar on the Ukrainian Interbank Currency Exchange from 1.81 at the previous session.</p>
<p>				    October 31	   October 30</p>
<p> Hryvnia rate to dollar	  1.82		   1.81</p>
<p> Volume traded		  $20.100 million	  $20.430 million</p>
<p>--Kiev newsroom, +380 44 229 2264</p>
</text>
